    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Attendance expected and appreciated 請準時到課.\n2. In-class participation encouraged and appreciated. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n3. Attendance will not be taken on a regular basis, though students will need rigorous documentation for leave of absence for an exam or a presentation that concerns grading.學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。\n4. Purchase of the textbook will be encouraged, but not required. 請購買正版課本，請勿使用複製版本。\n5. No plagiarism or cheating or any misconduct will be tolerated. 考試請遵照考場規定，若作弊者以0分計算。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "As a bottom line, no food and drinks in the classroom, please.\nDrinking water will be fine.",
